 "notes": "First beta for Windows and Linux\n- Browse folders like Explorer or Files: tabs, sidebar, address bar, Details, Large icons, Columns, Gallery and Globe views.\n- Three looks on every system: Windows 11, macOS and Linux (GNOME), each light, dark or Midnight.\n- A media player in the window: plays MP4, MOV, ProRes, MKV and more (a playback copy when needed), frame steps, trim, queue.\n- Hover a video in Large icons or Gallery to scrub through it.\n- Search: this folder, subfolders or the whole PC, Advanced Search, duplicates, Smart Folders, tags and playlists.\n- Transcripts on this PC (whisper.cpp comes with the app) or with OpenAI / Groq, AI Review, subtitles in and out, search by spoken words.\n- Folder backgrounds: colours, gradients, pictures, GIF, video, Lottie and Rive, in layers.\n- The Windows app and the Linux AppImage update themselves.",
